000FCFr 2               ;	Y,A POINTS AT COEFFICIENT TABLE
000FCFr 2               ;	FIRST BYTE OF COEFF. TABLE IS N
000FCFr 2               ;	COEFFICIENTS FOLLOW, HIGHEST POWER FIRST
