000FE5r 2               ; WHERE:  X IS VALUE IN FAC
000FE5r 2               ;	Y,A POINTS AT COEFFICIENT TABLE
000FE5r 2               ;	FIRST BYTE OF COEFF. TABLE IS N
000FE5r 2               ;	COEFFICIENTS FOLLOW, HIGHEST POWER FIRST
